  "description": "Synthetic fired engine driving an ideal reversible displacement pump, compliant line and finite-conductance pressure relief, mapped converter and pressure-operated planetary shift/lockup elements. Pump pressure reaction loads the crank in the same midpoint solve; positive hydraulic supply work comes from the shaft. Tank gauge pressure is zero. Initial line and brake pressure are explicit stored energy. All geometry, maps and schedules are unverified research inputs. Leakage, cavitation, spool/piston dynamics, full gearbox topology, ECU/TCU coordination and OEM calibration remain unfinished.",
